   113	Prove infinite-behavior adequacy too: compatible limits of fuel-indexed execution prefixes correspond to infinite maximal executions, and every such execution has those prefixes. Carry states and steps as well as event traces: silent divergence has infinitely many steps but only finitely many events; infinite interaction has infinitely many events. An endlessly blocked run retains its blocking classification. Independent finite witnesses do not establish a compatible infinite run. This follows Q9.9 and [A1, “Fuel and divergence”](../legacy/docs/compiler/A1_BOUNDARIES.md).
